# Phase 0 Completion Report — WoWS OCR + YOLO Discord Bot v2.5.0

**Review date:** 2026-10-24  
**Disposition:** **PHASE 0 COMPLETE — baseline reconciliation and package-integrity acceptance passed.**  
**Important boundary:** This is not a declaration that the Tesseract.js fallback is accurate enough for production. Accuracy, repeated sequential-lifecycle/stall recovery, true no-network acceptance, native Windows Tesseract comparison, and live Discord smoke tests are later-phase work and remain open.

## Scope used for closure

Phase 0 is the baseline-reconciliation scope: fix the failing public-panel test; rerun the targeted and full tests; validate syntax and package/lockfile metadata; verify the workbook/hash; preserve the original baseline evidence; and assemble an integrity-checked release ZIP that excludes installed dependencies, secrets, and live state. Phase 0 does not mean all later OCR quality/reliability requirements are solved.

